  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons</p>\n<p><em>“They'll just send in some special ops douchebags with pussy-ass heartbeat monitors on their guns, instead of us.” — NUS Army Soldier</em></p>\n<p>Equips the weapon with a side-mounted folding screen that can be collapsed or extended without an Action. While the screen is extended, the weapon cannot be concealed. The Sonar Sensor does not function while the screen is collapsed. While active, the Sonar Sensor scans all terrain within 25m/yds, including underwater, for new threats. This cannot scan through any form of Cover, except Bulletproof Shields. The user receives a beep from the screen whenever a new moving object is detected along with the general direction of its source.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Scopes &amp; Sights).</em></p>"
